  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centre of excellence for newborn care in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2014, we have treated over 20,000 babies and saved over 7000 lives. This dramatic success can be attributed to a sustainable training model and provision of good quality basic newborn care in partnership. Our Centre of Excellence for Newborn Care is a national training centre recognised by the Ministry of Health. Born on the Edge provides sustainable support to Mbale Regional Referral Hospital by flexibly filling critical gaps that directly contribute to saving newborn lives.</narrative>
  </description>
